    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Storm Dragon Lindvior's underling. During the war against the gods, it fought together with the other dragons against the gods. After receiving a grave injury, it went deep into the woods and fell asleep. It recently awakened after feeling the power of Shilen flowing out from the Tower of Insolence. It is a bit smaller than a regular Drake, but because of its swift movements, it is sometimes mistaken for the Wind Dragon itself. Dragons Lv. 10 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Dragons. P. Def. +5% Max HP +5% Attack Range +30 Resistance to Hold +15% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% M. Def. -5% Resistance to Sword -10% Resistance to Dual Sword -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
